      "parts": [
        { "visual": "Tipos de gráficas: Bar chart (gráfico de barras), Line chart (gráfico de líneas), Pie chart (gráfico circular). Ejes: X-axis (eje horizontal), Y-axis (eje vertical).", "audio": "Types of charts: Bar chart, Line chart, Pie chart. Axes: X-axis, which is horizontal, and Y-axis, which is vertical." },
        { "visual": "Tendencias: Go up / Rise / Increase (subir). Go down / Fall / Decrease (bajar). Stay the same / Remain stable (mantenerse estable). Reach a peak (alcanzar el máximo).", "audio": "Trends: Go up, rise, or increase means to go higher. Go down, fall, or decrease means to go lower. Stay the same or remain stable. Reach a peak means to reach the highest point." }
      ]
